    This program sets up the Chinese Social Credit Test 3.30. It copies
    the files needed for the game to work. It also creates the directory 
    named \SCT for the game files. For now, insert the Game Disk in drive B:
    then press ENTER or any other keys. If you want to quit, press 
    Ctrl+Break or Ctrl+Scroll.




   Note: Install Disk should be in drive A: before inserting the Game Disk
         in drive B:. Otherwise, it might not work when you switch the 
         diskettes or use it in other drives. Also, if you don't have
         BASRUN20.exe, we will put it to \SCT and install it for you.

